    \caption{
        \textbf{Effect of length-aware reward weighting on MBPP.} Both variants are trained at $L=256$ and evaluated across canvases $L\in\{128, 256, 512\}$. Length-aware weighting prevents the model from generating unnecessarily long correct programs simply to fill the canvas.
